ce":"髙渠彌","kind":"person","person_id":"f23_b0p_hqg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m011-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"太子忽","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m011-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"莊公","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m011-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"渠彌","kind":"person","person_id":"f23_b0p_hqg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m011-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m011-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"渠彌","kind":"person","person_id":"f23_b0p_hqg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m011-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m011-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m011-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"祭仲","kind":"person","person_id":"63x_7fc_69z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m011-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"渠彌","kind":"person","person_id":"f23_b0p_hqg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m011-0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"厲公","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m011-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m011-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"子亹","kind":"person","person_id":"5zd_tsn_2xr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m011-0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"子亹","kind":"person","person_id":"5zd_tsn_2xr","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng","book_id":"b-shiji-042","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-042-zheng"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p012","text":"子亹元年七月，齊襄公會諸侯於首止，鄭子亹往會，髙渠彌相，從，祭仲稱疾不行。所以然者，子亹自齊襄公爲公子之時，嘗會鬬，相仇，及會諸侯，祭仲請子亹無行。子亹曰：「齊彊，而厲公居櫟，卽不往，是率諸侯伐我，内厲公。我不如往，往何遽必辱，且又何至是！」卒行。於是祭仲恐齊并殺之，故稱疾。子亹至，不謝齊侯，齊侯怒，遂伏甲而殺子亹。髙渠彌亡歸，歸與祭仲謀，召子亹弟公子嬰於陳而立之，是爲鄭子。是歳，齊襄公使彭生醉拉殺魯桓公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m012-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"子亹","kind":"person","person_id":"5zd_tsn_2xr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m012-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"齊襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"k8n_rwt_70b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m012-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"鄭子亹","kind":"person","person_id":"5zd_tsn_2xr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m012-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"髙渠彌","kind":"person","person_id":"f23_b0p_hqg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m012-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"祭仲","kind":"person","person_id":"63x_7fc_69z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m012-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"子亹","kind":"person","person_id":"5zd_tsn_2xr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m012-0045","start":45,"end":48,"surface":"齊襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"k8n_rwt_70b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m012-0049","start":49,"end":53,"surface":"公子之時","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名、群體、泛稱或指代待核；不補姓名、成員或親屬關係。"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m012-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"祭仲","kind":"person","person_id":"63x_7fc_69z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m012-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"子亹","kind":"person","person_id":"5zd_tsn_2xr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zhen